      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the detectives, consider the following archetypes: a seasoned, veteran homicide detective who's seen it all and struggles to connect with the younger generation; a reckless, hot-headed rookie looking to prove themselves; and a sharp, analytical outsider brought in from a different department to shake up the unit. \n\nFor the gang members and thugs, consider the following archetypes: a charismatic, street-smart leader who's both ruthless and empathetic; a young, impressionable recruit trying to prove their worth to the crew; and a low-level player desperate to avoid getting caught or killed.",
